WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:05.080
Over the weekend, NVIDIA's leather-loving co-founder and CEO, Jensen Huang, sent out an

00:05.080 --> 00:10.100
email to all 42,000 of his employees declaring that he had been unfaithful to his wife. Now,

00:10.160 --> 00:13.200
normally, that would be a personal problem for him to figure out with his family,

00:13.380 --> 00:18.460
and potentially a very expensive lawyer. But US intelligence believes the woman involved works for

00:18.460 --> 00:23.360
China's Ministry of State Security, and also happens to be behind a tiny company in Singapore

00:23.360 --> 00:28.480
that bought billions of dollars worth of NVIDIA's best GPUs. Since then, NVIDIA's stock has been

00:28.480 --> 00:30.000
getting eviscerated, shareholders

00:30.000 --> 00:34.640
are suing, and Congress is threatening a subpoena. In today's video, we'll look at how you get banned

00:34.640 --> 00:39.260
GPUs into China, how a couple of guys reading corporate filings actually broke this story six

00:39.260 --> 00:44.120
months ago, and what the future looks like for the most important company in AI. It is November 12,

00:44.300 --> 00:48.860
2026, and you're watching The Code Report. To understand how we got here, we need to go back

00:48.860 --> 00:53.980
to late 2022, when Kate Bush was topping the charts, and the Biden admin banned Nvidia from

00:53.980 --> 00:58.320
selling chips to China. A few months later, a Chinese gaming company called 7Road

00:58.320 --> 01:00.000
that spun off its Singapore

01:00.000 --> 01:05.080
subsidiary and sold it to a shell in the British Virgin Islands named Huang Le Limited. Huang Le

01:05.080 --> 01:10.160
is the Chinese name for Alice Huang, the mistress of Jensen Huang, and I want to make this clear,

01:10.340 --> 01:14.960
the two of them have no genetic relation to each other, I think. Alice's resume says she used to

01:14.960 --> 01:19.840
be a TV broadcaster in China, although no one can find any proof of that happening. With Alice in

01:19.840 --> 01:24.840
control, that Singapore subsidiary was renamed Megaspeed, and despite a LinkedIn page listing

01:24.840 --> 01:30.140
two to 10 employees, it went on to buy more than $4.8 billion of NVIDIA hardware in just two years,

01:30.160 --> 01:34.880
and the business model is actually pretty clever. Since the US regulation only cares about where a

01:34.880 --> 01:38.900
chip physically sits and who owns the company that bought it, all you need is a company that isn't

01:38.900 --> 01:44.480
Chinese and a data center that isn't in China. So Megaspeed, a Singapore company, buys the NVIDIA

01:44.480 --> 01:49.360
GPUs and racks them in data centers in Malaysia and Indonesia, and then rents the compute to

01:49.360 --> 01:54.060
Alibaba, who uses them to train models on chips it's not allowed to own. It's sketchy, but

01:54.060 --> 01:54.840
technically legal,

01:54.840 --> 02:00.520
but US investigators suspected something worse was going on, and so in 2024, a Commerce Department

02:00.520 --> 02:05.500
