just sitting there unopened, as if they were about to be redistributed for the good of the

02:09.280 --> 02:14.420
collective. Meanwhile, the Huangs kept showing up in the same places, and then on May 13th of this

02:14.420 --> 02:19.000
year, a short seller called Culper Research published a 40-page report titled The China

02:19.000 --> 02:23.780
Problem. In it, they showed how Megaspeed's balance sheet went from $33 million to $3 billion

02:23.780 --> 02:24.840
in a single year,

02:24.840 --> 02:28.180
with almost all of it coming from deposits from a source nobody could name.

02:28.340 --> 02:34.800
They also showed that Megaspeed's Malaysian subsidiary had pledged its entire business as collateral to a company called Apex,

02:34.980 --> 02:36.360
whose parent is Alibaba.

02:36.560 --> 02:41.220
So technically, NVIDIA could say with a straight face that its customer had no Chinese shareholders,

02:41.540 --> 02:44.440
while in reality, Alibaba was allegedly paying for everything.

02:44.620 --> 02:49.520
The report even called Jensen and Alice's non-incestuous relationship uncomfortably close.

02:49.640 --> 02:53.440
And that same week, Jensen boarded Air Force One to fly to Beijing with the president.

02:53.440 --> 02:54.840
And according to the Times,

02:54.840 --> 02:59.440
that's the trip where Marco Rubio told Trump that Jensen was in a relationship with a suspected

02:59.440 --> 03:03.760
Chinese spy, although Trump claims he didn't hear about it then. Five months later, the Times

